    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://movies.shochiku.co.jp/oishikute-nakutoki/",
          "overview": "Bound by shared loneliness, Shinya and his classmate Yuka grow close while working on their school newspaper. But after a sudden incident, Yuka vanishes without a trace, leaving Shinya clinging to an unfulfilled promise. Thirty years later, long-buried truths about Yuka’s past finally surface, forcing Shinya to confront what was lost, and what remained unsaid.",
          "runtime": 109,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Taste and Tears"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "JP",
        "iso_639_1": "ja",
        "name": "日本語",
        "english_name": "Japanese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "幼い頃に母を亡くした心也と、家に居場所がない同級生の夕花。学級新聞の編集委員を任された2人は、最初はぎくしゃくするも次第に打ち解け、2人だけで「ひま部」を結成する。それぞれ孤独を抱える心也と夕花は距離を縮めていくが、ある事件をきっかけに夕花は姿を消し、心也は行き場のない思いを抱えたまま、交わした約束を胸に彼女を待つ。突然の別れから30年が経ったある日、夕花の秘密が明かされる。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "世界のどこかで君が笑っていますように",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "本作改编自作家森泽明夫的原作小说。影片讲述了小时候母亲去世的心也与在家中没有归属感的夕花之间的故事。这对同班同学因机缘巧合成立了“闲暇部”，原本孤独的两人逐渐拉近了的距离。然而，一场意外事件后，夕花突然消失了。心也怀抱着无处诉说的情感，遵守着两人之间的约定，默默等待她的归来。在这突如其来的离别过去30年后，夕花的秘密终于浮出水面。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "美味到流泪"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TW",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "幼年喪母的心也，與無法在家中找到歸屬感的夕花同學，因緣際會在校成立「閒人社」，感到孤獨的兩人漸漸拉近彼此的距離。然而，夕花突然失蹤，被留下的心也無處可去，獨自守候兩人之間的約定，等待夕花回來。三十年後，夕花的祕密終於被揭穿。",
          "runtime": 108,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "從那天起．眼淚是美味的"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Depois de perder a mãe na infância, o colegial Shinya Fuma (Kento Nagao) mora com o pai solteiro, dono de um restaurante que oferece refeições grátis a crianças carentes — entre elas a colega Yuka Arai (Ami Touma). No jornal da escola, Shinya e Yuka ficam mais próximos e ele se apaixona. Ao visitar a casa dela e ver o pai agredi‑la, Shinya a leva para uma fuga de uma noite. No dia seguinte, Yuka e a família se mudam, e ele perde o rastro. Trinta anos depois, Shinya assume o restaurante e o projeto social, ainda esperando reencontrá‑la — até que uma visitante inesperada muda tudo. Adaptado do romance homônimo de Akio Morikawa.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Sabor e lágrimas"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "ES",
        "iso_639_1": "es",
        "name": "Español",
        "english_name": "Spanish",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Un chico se enamora de su compañera y quiere salvarla de su padre violento, pero ella desaparece — ¿se reunirán décadas después?",
